  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nWelcome to Dani Ink, a premier tattoo studio nestled in the heart of Bad Wildungen, Germany, on the charming Lindenstraße. Specializing in the intricate and timeless black & gray tattoo style, our studio is a sanctuary for those looking to etch artful mastery onto their canvas. Helmed by the celebrated CEO and artist @dani_ink_0407, Dani Ink pledges an experience seeped in creativity and professionalism #h0lyc0w.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bad Wildungen, Hesse, Germany"
